    {
      "Col1": "Peyton Streko",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "RB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "5.1",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "9/16/2026",
      "Col10": "The senior walk-on is recovering from surgery after a shin injury cost him all of 2025. Dabo Swinney put him in the long-term category in August, and he is not expected to play in 2026.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Adam Guthrie",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "OL",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "10.8",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "9/20/2026",
      "Col10": "The true freshman tore his meniscus in summer workouts and is also being treated for a lingering high school injury. The meniscus has been repaired, but Dabo Swinney does not expect him to play in 2026.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Polo Anderson",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "S",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "12.6",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "9/11/2026",
      "Col10": "Tore his ACL in practice on Aug. 14, and Dabo Swinney confirmed a clean tear after the next day's scrimmage. The freshman safety had been in line for a significant role and will miss the season after surgery.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "David Eziomume",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "RB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "10.8",
      "Col8": "2",
      "Col9": "9/27/2026",
      "Col10": "Injured his lower left leg while blocking on a kickoff return in the first quarter of the 24-10 win at Cal on Sept. 25 and left on a cart in an air cast. Dabo Swinney ruled him out for the year two days later and said the surgery is similar to the one Markus Strong needed.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Markus Strong",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "DT",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "12.2",
      "Col8": "2",
      "Col9": "9/8/2026",
      "Col10": "Suffered a lower-leg injury that required surgery in the Sept. 5 opener at LSU and has not played since. Dabo Swinney first said he was probably done for the year but said on Nov. 3 that he hopes to have him back for South Carolina on Nov. 28.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Corian Gipson",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "CB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "11.8",
      "Col8": "2",
      "Col9": "10/7/2026",
      "Col10": "Aggravated a knee injury in the Oct. 3 loss to Miami, and a follow-up MRI showed damage that requires surgery. The Week 1 starter at nickel faces a three-to-four-month recovery and is out for the season.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Braden Wilmes",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "OFS",
      "Col5": "OL",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "10.0",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "11/4/2026",
      "Col10": "Tore his ACL in practice on Nov. 4 and is out for the season. Dabo Swinney called the loss of his freshman backup tackle a big one for the line's depth.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Shavar Young Jr.",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "CB",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "10.0",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "10/1/2026",
      "Col10": "Has been listed as out with an undisclosed injury since at least the Oct. 3 Miami game. The freshman cornerback remains out for the Nov. 14 game against Georgia Tech with no timetable given.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Cole Turner",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "WR",
      "Col6": "",
      "Col7": "11.3",
      "Col8": "1",
      "Col9": "10/1/2026",
      "Col10": "Practiced on the first day of fall camp, then stepped away from the team to handle a personal matter with the program's support. Dabo Swinney said on Nov. 4 that the fifth-year receiver is doing fine and remains on the team but is not with the program right now.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Mason Wade",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "OL",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "10.8",
      "Col8": "0",
      "Col9": "10/1/2026",
      "Col10": "Has been listed as out with an undisclosed injury since at least the Oct. 3 Miami game. The offensive lineman remains out for the Nov. 14 game against Georgia Tech with no timetable given.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Armon Mason",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "DE",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "9.5",
      "Col8": "2",
      "Col9": "10/21/2026",
      "Col10": "Played against LSU and Georgia Southern before pain returned around the rod in his leg from a previous injury. Dabo Swinney said on Oct. 29 that he will take a medical hardship and needs another surgery, which ends his season.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Tyler Brown",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "WR",
      "Col6": "TRUE",
      "Col7": "12.3",
      "Col8": "4",
      "Col9": "11/13/2026",
      "Col10": "Official report 2026-11-13: out. Game 2026-11-14. Previous context: Rolled his ankle catching a pass in practice on Nov. 3 and missed the 18-13 win at Syracuse, though the injury does not require surgery. Dabo Swinney called him day-to-day, and he is questionable for the Nov. 14 game against Georgia Tech.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Gideon Davidson",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "RB",
      "Col6": "TRUE",
      "Col7": "13.5",
      "Col8": "5",
      "Col9": "11/13/2026",
      "Col10": "Official report 2026-11-13: out. Game 2026-11-14. Previous context: Suffered a low-grade ankle sprain in the Oct. 31 win at Florida State and sat out the trip to Syracuse a week later. The team's leading rusher is day-to-day and questionable for the Nov. 14 game against Georgia Tech, with Jarvis Green set to start if he cannot go.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Elyjah Thurmon",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "OL",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "11.4",
      "Col8": "3",
      "Col9": "11/4/2026",
      "Col10": "Took a hit to the head in the Oct. 31 win at Florida State, left on a cart and was taken to a hospital. The starting left guard remains in concussion protocol and is out for a second straight game on Nov. 14 against Georgia Tech, with Gavin Blanchard starting in his place.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Harris Sewell",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "OL",
      "Col6": "FALSE",
      "Col7": "13.1",
      "Col8": "3",
      "Col9": "11/4/2026",
      "Col10": "Injured his ankle in the second half of the Oct. 31 win at Florida State and had a tightrope procedure. The starting center is out for the Nov. 14 game against Georgia Tech, and Dabo Swinney said he could be ready for Duke but is targeting South Carolina on Nov. 28 at the latest.",
      "Col11": "0"
    },
    {
      "Col1": "Donovan Starr",
      "Col2": "",
      "Col3": "",
      "Col4": "O",
      "Col5": "CB",
      "Col6": "TRUE",
      "Col7": "13.1",
      "Col8": "5",
      "Col9": "11/11/2026",
      "Col10": "Went down with an ankle injury midway through the second quarter of the 18-13 win at Syracuse on Nov. 7 and did not return. Dabo Swinney said he is probably out for the season with a chance to return for the postseason, and Branden Strozier takes over at nickel.",
      "Col11": "21"
    },
